Category: Changed

The version filtering logic in the release section merge has been simplified by parsing each version once per iteration, improving readability and maintainability without changing functional behavior. This change affects how versions are filtered for generated release sections. The _make_repo test helper now explicitly declares its return type as GitRepository to aid static analysis and IDE support. Additionally, the encode function's return value is cast to str in git_helper.py to ensure type checkers recognize the correct type and prevent potential runtime errors.
